#. Tag: title
#: kde-office.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Office"
msgstr "ការិយាល័យ"

#. Tag: title
#: kde-office.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction to KOffice"
msgstr "សេចក្ដី​ណែនាំ​ចំពោះ KOffice"

#. Tag: title
#: kde-office.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "ទិដ្ឋភាព​ទូទៅ"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kde; project has also created a fully featured office suite called "
"&koffice; which adheres to standards and fits very well into the &kde; desktop. "
"This section was written with version 1.4 of &koffice; in mind."
msgstr ""
"គម្រោង KDE បាន​បង្កើត​យ៉ាង​ពេញលេញ​នូវ​ឈុត​ការិយាល័យ​ដែល​មាន​លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស​ហៅ​ថា "
"KOffice ដែល​ជា​ស្តង់ដារ និង​សម​យ៉ាង​ប្រសើរ​ទៅ​ក្នុង​ផ្ទៃតុ KDE ។ "
"ផ្នែក​នេះ​ត្រូវ​បាន​សរសេរ​ជាមួយ​កំណែ ១.៤ នៃ KOffice នៅ​ក្នុង​គំនិត ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&koffice; is a highly integrated office suite that builds directly on the KDE "
"technology. This has many advantages in terms of integration, features, "
"performance, familiar look and feel and so on. All technologies like &DCOP;, "
"KIO, KParts are directly available."
msgstr ""
"KOffice "
"ត្រូវ​បាន​រួម​បញ្ចូល​ជាមួយ​ឈុត​ការិយាល័យ​ដែល​សង់​ដោយ​ផ្ទាល់​ដោយ​បច្ចេកវិទ្យា "
"KDE ។ នេះ​មាន​គុណ​សម្បត្តិ​ច្រើន ដូច​ជា ការ​រួម​បញ្ចូល លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស ដំណើរ​ការ "
"រូបរាង និង​ច្រើន​ទៀត ។ បច្ចេកវិទ្យា​ទាំងអស់​ដូចជា DCOP KIO KParts "
"មាន​ដោយ​ផ្ទាល់ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In particular the KParts technology is extended for the &koffice; components to "
"allow very flexible embedding of documents inside documents."
msgstr ""
"ជា​ពិសេស បច្ចេកវិទ្យា KParts ត្រូវ​បាន​ពង្រីក​សម្រាប់​សមាសភាគ KOffice "
"ដើម្បី​អនុញ្ញាត​ការ​បង្កប់​ដែល​អាច​បត់​បែន​នៃ​ឯកសារ​ខាងក្នុង​ឯកសារ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Because much technology is already present inside &kde; itself, &koffice; is a "
"very lightweight office suite, which results in fast application startup and "
"low memory consumption. This makes &koffice; a very suitable office suite for "
"older hardware as well, which can save lots of costs in some cases."
msgstr ""
"ពីព្រោះ​បច្ចេកវិទ្យា​ភាគ​ច្រើន​មាន​នៅ​ក្នុង KDE ខ្លួន​វា​ហើយ  KOffice "
"ជា​ឈុត​ការិយាល័យ​ស្រាល​បំផុត ដែល​មាន​លទ្ធផល ចាប់ផ្ដើម​កម្មវិធី​លឿន "
"និង​ប្រើប្រាស់​សតិ​តិច ។ នេះ​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ KOffice "
"ជា​ឈុត​កម្មវិធី​ដែល​សម​បំផុត​ជាមួយ​ផ្នែក​រឹង​ចាស់ៗ​ផង​ដែរ "
"ដែល​អាច​សន្សំ​ការ​ចំណាយ​ជាច្រើន​ក្នុង​ករណី​ខ្លះ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&koffice; is also a very feature complete office suite. It is not limited to "
"word processing, spreadsheets or presentations, but has also components for "
"image manipulation, flow charts, business report generation, database "
"management and project management. Because of the flexible component "
"integration smaller utilities like the diagram and chart engine as well as the "
"formula editor are available as stand alone tools."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As you can see &koffice; brings a lot of features that can enrich your office "
"experience. Its straight forward and &kde; like approach in look and feel as "
"well as familiar usability makes &koffice; quite useful for daily office work."
msgstr ""
"ដូច​ដែល​អ្នក​បាន​ឃើញ Koffice "
"នាំ​មក​នូវ​លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស​ជាច្រើន​ដែល​អាច​ធ្វើ​បទ​ពិសោធន៍​ការិយាល័យ​របស់​អ្នក​កាន់"
"​តែ​សម្បូរ​បែប ។ Its straight forward and &kde; like approach in look and feel "
"as well as familiar usability makes &koffice; quite useful for daily office "
"work."

#. Tag: title
#: kde-office.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "Features"
msgstr "លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This list gives a general outline of the &koffice; features. The &koffice; "
"office suite is too large to list every detail."
msgstr ""
"បញ្ជី​នៃ​ផ្ដល់​គ្រោង​ទូទៅ​នៃ​លក្ខណៈ​សម្បត្តិ Koffice ។ "
"ឈុត​ការិយាល័យ​ធំ​ពេក​ក្នុង​ការ​រាយ​លម្អិត​នីមួយៗ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: kde-office.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid "&koffice; features:"
msgstr "លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស KOffice ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Fully builds on &kde; which makes these technologies available at low costs."
msgstr ""
"សង់​យ៉ាង​ពេញលេញ​លើ KDE ដែល​ធ្វើ​បច្ចេកវិទ្យា​ទាំងនេះ​មាន​នៅ​តម្លៃ​ទាប ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fully integrates into &kde; which is vital for business environments."
msgstr ""
"រួម​បញ្ចូល​យ៉ាង​ពេញលេញ​នៅ​ក្នុង KDE ដែល​សំខាន់​សម្រាប់​បរិស្ថាន​ពាណិជ្ជកម្ម ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kde; technologies include document location abstraction, DCOP scripting, parts "
"and plugins,..."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "Full Component embedding."
msgstr "ការ​បង្កប់​សមាសភាគ​ពេញលេញ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "Low memory footprint, fast startup, lightweight."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "Feature complete: many components are offered."
msgstr "ការ​បំពេញ​លក្ខណៈ​សម្បត្តិ ៖ សមាសភាគ​ជាច្រើន​ត្រូវ​បាន​ផ្ដល់ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "Intuitive, good looking and easy to learn user interface."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adheres to standards: OASIS OpenDocument file format."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: kde-office.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "OASIS OpenDocument file format"
msgstr "ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​ឯកសារ OASIS OpenDocument"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is important for an office suite to use standards where possible, especially "
"for the file format. The OASIS OpenDocument file format specification is an "
"open standard for office applications. This format is spreading more and more, "
"it is also the same file format OpenOffice.org uses, which means that file "
"exchange with any user of this office suite is easily possible."
msgstr ""
"វា​សំខាន់​សម្រាប់​ឈុត​ការិយាល័យ​ដើម្បី​ប្រើ​ស្តង់ដារ​ដែល​អាច​ទៅ​រួច "
"ជា​ពិសេស​សម្រាប់​ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​ឯកសារ ។ សេចក្ដី​បញ្ជាក់​ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​ឯកសារ OASIS "
"OpenDocument គឺ​ជា​ស្តង់ដារ​ទូលាយ​សម្រាប់​កម្មវិធី​ការិយាល័យ ។ "
"ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​នេះ​ត្រូវ​បាន​រាល​ដាល​ច្រើន​ឡើងៗ "
"វា​គឺ​ជា​ការ​ប្រើប្រាស់​ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​ឯកសារ OpenOffice.org ដូច​គ្នា "
"ដែល​មាន​ន័យ​ថា​ឯកសារ​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​ជាមួយ​អ្នក​ប្រើ​ណា​មួយ​នៃ​ឈុត​ការិយាល័យ​នេះ​អាច"
"​យ៉ាង​ងាយស្រួល ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adhering to official standards is always a good thing. For business "
"environments it is even vital to exactly know about their documents."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&koffice; has more components to offer than what is covered by the OASIS "
"specification. Still, all components covered by the specifications actually use "
"the OASIS OpenDocument file format."
msgstr ""
"Koffice "
"មាន​សមាសភាគ​ដើម្បី​ផ្ដល់​ច្រើន​ជាង​អ្វី​ដែល​គ្រប់​ដណ្ដប់​ដោយ​សេចក្ដី​បញ្ជាក់ "
"OASIS ។ "
"សមាសភាគ​ទាំងអស់​ដែល​គ្រប់​ដណ្ដប់​ដោយ​សេចក្ដី​បញ្ជាក់​ប្រើ​យ៉ាង​ពិត​នូវ​ទ្រង់ទ្រា"
"យ​ឯកសារ OASIS OpenDocument ។"

#. Tag: title
#: kde-office.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid "&koffice; Components Overview"
msgstr "ទិដ្ឋភាព​ទូទៅ​សមាសភាគ KOffice"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that all these components can integrate very well into each other. "
"So basically a spreadsheet can contain anything from charts to presentations, "
"reports and even text documents. Likewise almost any component can contain "
"almost any other."
msgstr ""
"សូម​ចងចាំ​ថា សមាសភាគ​ទាំងនេះ​អាច​បញ្ចូល​យ៉ាង​ល្អ​ទៅ​ក្នុង​គ្នា​នីមួយៗ ។ ដូច្នេះ "
"ជា​មូលដ្ឋាន​សៀវភៅ​បញ្ជី​អាច​មាន​អ្វី​ពី​គំនូស​តាង​ដើម្បី​បង្ហាញ រាយការណ៍ "
"និង​ឯកសារ​អត្ថបទ ។ ដូច​ជា​សមាសភាគ​មួយ​ចំនួន​ភាគ​ច្រើន​អាច​មាន​ទាំងអស់ ។"

#. Tag: term
#: kde-office.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kword;"
msgstr "KWord"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The textprocessing component, but it includes many aspects of a desktop "
"publishing application. This creates a rather unique mixture of features that "
"makes interesting layouts easily possible."
msgstr ""
"សមាសភាគ​ដំណើរ​ការ​វាយ​អត្ថបទ "
"ប៉ុន្តែ​វា​រួម​បញ្ចូល​ទិដ្ឋភាព​មួយ​ចំនួន​នៃ​ផ្ទៃតុ​ដែល​បោះពុម្ព​កម្មវិធី ។ "
"នេះ​បង្កើត​ល្បាយ​នៃ​លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស​ដែល​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​ប្លង់​ដែល​ចាប់​អារម្មណ៍​កាន់​តែ​ងា"
"យស្រួល ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kword/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kword/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kword/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kword/</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-office.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kword; Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ KWord"

#. Tag: term
#: kde-office.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kspread;"
msgstr "Kspread"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The spreadsheet component. &kspread; is a scriptable spreadsheet program which "
"provides both table-oriented sheets and support for complex mathematical "
"formulas and statistics. Features include Hyperlinks, cell data validity "
"checking with configurable warnings/actions, scripting and specific cell "
"customization."
msgstr ""
"សមាសភាគ​សន្លឹក ។ Kspread គឺ​ជា​កម្មវិធី​សៀវភៅ​បញ្ជី​ដែល​អាច​ស្គ្រីប​បាន "
"ដែល​ផ្ដល់​ទាំង​សន្លឹក​តារាង និង​គាំទ្រ​សម្រាប់​រូបមន្ត​គណិត​ស្មុគស្មាញ "
"និង​ស្ថិតិ ។ លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស​រួម​បញ្ចូល​តំណ​ខ្ពស់ "
"សុពលភាព​ទិន្នន័យ​ក្រឡា​ពិនិត្យ​ជាមួយ​សកម្មភាព/ការ​ព្រមាន​ដែល​អាច​កំណត់​រចនា​សម្ព"
"័ន្ធ​បន ស្គ្រីប និង​ការ​ប្ដូរ​តាម​បំណង​ក្រឡា​ជាក់លាក់ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kspread/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kspread/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kspread/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kspread/</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-office.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kspread; Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ KSpread"

#. Tag: term
#: kde-office.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kpresenter;"
msgstr "Kpresenter"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The presentation component. It can be used to create on-screen presentations or "
"to design and print transparencies. Features include embedding images and "
"clip-art, easy working with objects, and the ability to make &HTML; or &XML; "
"slideshows."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kpresenter/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kpresenter/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kpresenter/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kpresenter/</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-office.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kpresenter; Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ KPresenter"

#. Tag: term
#: kde-office.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kivio;"
msgstr "Kivio"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The flowcharting and diagramming component. Additional stencil sets can be used "
"for custom needs, there is a plugin framework for additional functionality, and "
"even <acronym>UML</acronym> diagrams are possible."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kivio/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kivio/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kivio/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kivio/</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-office.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kivio; Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ Kivio"

#. Tag: term
#: kde-office.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid "&karbon14;"
msgstr "Karbon14"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid "A vector-drawing application."
msgstr "កម្មវិធី​គូរ​វ៉ិចទ័រ"

#. Tag: term
#: kde-office.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid "&krita;"
msgstr "KRita"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The painting and image manipulation component. &krita; contains both "
"ease-of-use, fun features like guided painting, as well as high-end features "
"like support for 16-bit images, <acronym>CMYK</acronym> "
"and even OpenEXR <acronym>HDR</acronym> images."
msgstr ""
"សមាសភាគ​រៀបចំ​រូបភាព និង​គំនូរ ។ KRita មាន​ភាព​ងាយស្រួល​ក្នុង​ការ​ប្រើ "
"លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស​ដូចជា គំនូរ​ដែល​នាំ​ផ្លូវ រួម​ទាំង​លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស​ចុងក្រោយ​ខ្ពស់ "
"ដូចជា​ការ​គាំទ្រ​សម្រាប់​រូបភាព 16-bit <acronym>CMYK</acronym> "
"និង​សូម្បី​តែ​រូបភាព OpenEXR <acronym>HDR</acronym> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/krita/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/krita/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"រូប​តំណាង ៖ <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/krita/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/krita/</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-office.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid "&krita; Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ KRita"

#. Tag: term
#: kde-office.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kugar;"
msgstr "Kugar"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The appropriate component for creating business reports, which is accomplished "
"with an advanced designer that it has. Features include report printing in "
"postscript, full control of fonts, colors, text alignment and wrapping, as well "
"as open report definition files (with the layout stored as &XML;)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kugar/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kugar/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kugar/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kugar/</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-office.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kugar; Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ Kugar"

#. Tag: application
#: kde-office.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid "KPlato"
msgstr "KPlato"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The component for project management, allowing for the planning and scheduling "
"of various projects."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kplato/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kplato/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kplato/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kplato/</ulink>"

#. Tag: term
#: kde-office.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kexi;"
msgstr "Kexi"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The data management component. It can be used for creating database schemas, "
"inserting data, performing queries, and processing data. Forms can be created "
"to provide a custom interface to your data. All database objects -- tables, "
"queries and forms -- are stored in the database, making it easy to share data "
"and database design."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kexi/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kexi/</ulink> and <ulink url=\"http://kexi-project.org\">"
"http://kexi-project.org</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kexi/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kexi/</ulink> and <ulink url=\"http://kexi-project.org\">"
"http://kexi-project.org</ulink> ។"

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-office.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kexi; Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ Kexi"

#. Tag: term
#: kde-office.docbook:251
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kchart;"
msgstr "KChart"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The chart drawing component; it is used to embed charts into one of the other "
"&koffice; components. It's easy to use, highly customizable allowing all of the "
"parameters to be changed, and has a flexible layout."
msgstr ""
"សមាសភាគ​គូរ​​គំនូស​តាង "
"វា​ត្រូវ​បាន​ប្រើ​ដើម្បី​បង្កប់​គំនូស​តាង​ទៅ​ក្នុង​សមាសភាគ KOffice "
"មួយ​ផ្សេង​ទៀត ។ វា​ងាយស្រួល​ប្រើ "
"អាច​ប្ដូរ​តាម​បំណង​អនុញ្ញាត​ប៉ារ៉ាម៉ែត្រ​ទាំងអស់​ឲ្យ​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ "
"និង​មាន​ផ្លង់​ដែល​អាច​បត់​បែន​បាន ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kchart/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kchart/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kchart/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kchart/</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-office.docbook:256
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kchart; Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ KChart"

#. Tag: term
#: kde-office.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kformula;"
msgstr "KFormula"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A formula editor which provides the basic input facilities and support "
"functionality that appears in other &koffice; applications. Some of its "
"features include intelligent cursor management, multi-level undo support and "
"advanced syntax highlighting."
msgstr ""
"កម្មវិធី​និពន្ធ​រូបមន្ត​ដែល​ផ្ដល់​បន្ទប់​ឧបករណ៍​បញ្ចូល​មូលដ្ឋាន "
"និង​គាំទ្រ​មុខងារ​ដែល​លេចឡើង​ក្នុង​កម្មវិធី KOffice ។ "
"លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស​របស់​វា​ខ្លះ​រួម​បញ្ចូល​ការ​គ្រប់គ្រង​ទស្សន៍​ទ្រនិច​វៃឆ្លាត "
"ការ​គាំទ្រ​មិន​ធ្វើ​កម្រិត​ច្រើន និង​ការ​បន្លិច​វាក្យ​សម្ព័ន្ធ​កម្រិត​ខ្ពស់ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kformula/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kformula/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org/kformula/\">"
"http://www.koffice.org/kformula/</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-office.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kformula; Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ KFormula"

#. Tag: title
#: kde-office.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "Related Information"
msgstr "ព័ត៌មាន​ដែល​ទាក់ទង"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Main website: <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org\">"
"http://www.koffice.org</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ​មេ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org\">"
"http://www.koffice.org</ulink>."

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-office.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid "&koffice; Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ KOffice"

#. Tag: title
#: kde-office.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid "Further Information"
msgstr "ព័ត៌មាន​បន្ថែម"

#. Tag: title
#: kde-office.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid "Application Manuals"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ​កម្មវិធី​អ្នក​ប្រើ"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each Koffice component comes with its own manual. These manuals offer all the "
"latest information about the various components &koffice; has to offer and "
"should be read to learn more about &koffice;. The application manuals can be "
"accessed by using the documentation KIO Slave in &konqueror; (that is, typing "
"<userinput>help:/<replaceable>application</replaceable></userinput> "
"into the Location toolbar) or by selecting the respective handbook from the "
"&khelpcenter;. The website is also a good place to find out more; it is at "
"<ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org\">http://www.koffice.org</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"សមាសភាគ Koffice នីមួយៗ​មក​ជាមួយ​សៀវភៅ​ដៃ​ផ្ទាល់​ខ្លួន​របស់​វា ។ "
"សៀវភៅ​ដៃ​ទាំងនេះ​ផ្ដល់​ព័ត៌មាន​ចុងក្រោយ​បំផុត​អំពី​សមាសភាគ​ផ្សេងៗ Koffice "
"ត្រូវ​តែ​ផ្ដល់ និង​គួរ​តែ​អាន​ដើម្បី​រៀន​បន្ថែម​អំពី Koffice ។ "
"សៀវភៅ​ដៃ​កម្មវិធី​អាច​ត្រូវ​បាន​ចូល​ដំណើរ​ការ​ដោយ​ប្រើ​កូនចៅ KIO ឯកសារ​នៅ​ក្នុង "
"Konqueror (គឺ​វាយ <userinput>help:/<replaceable>application</replaceable>"
"</userinput> ទៅ​ក្នុង​របារ​ឧបករណ៍​ទីតាំង) ឬ​ដោយ​ជ្រើស​សៀវភៅ​ដៃ​នីមួយៗ​ពី "
"Khelpcenter ។ តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ​គឺ​ជា​កន្លែង​ល្អ​ដើម្បី​រក​បន្ថែម វា​នៅ <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.koffice.org\">http://www.koffice.org</ulink> ។"

#. Tag: title
#: kde-office.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "Internet Resources"
msgstr "ធនធាន​អ៊ីនធឺណិត"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The primary site on the internet is <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org\">"
"http://www.koffice.org</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ​ចម្បង​នៅ​លើ​អ៊ីនធឺណិត​គឺ <ulink url=\"http://www.koffice.org\">"
"http://www.koffice.org</ulink>"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will also find information about the user and developer mailing lists as "
"well as additional developer resources."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​នឹង​រក​ឃើញ​ព័ត៌មាន​អំពី​បញ្ជី​សំបុត្រ​រួម​អ្នក​ប្រើ "
"និង​អ្នក​អភិវឌ្ឍន៍​រួម​ទាំង​ធនធាន​អ្នក​អភិវឌ្ឍន៍​បន្ថែម ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Kexi project has even an additional website, which can be found at <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.kexi-project.org\">http://www.kexi-project.org </ulink>"
msgstr ""
"គម្រោង Kexi មាន​តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ​បន្ថែម which can be found at <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.kexi-project.org\">http://www.kexi-project.org </ulink>"

#. Tag: title
#: kde-office.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plugin development"
msgstr "ការ​អភិវឌ្ឍន៍​កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-office.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&koffice; can easily be extended with plugins. Plugin development is not very "
"difficult and can be used to optimize your everyday workflow. Such capabilities "
"are probably very interesting in business environments to make &koffice; meet "
"individual requirements. You can either take a look at existing plugins or read "
"a general introduction at <ulink "
"url=\"http://developer.kde.org/documentation/tutorials/developing-a-plugin-struc"
"ture/index.html\"> the developer's site</ulink>. The general KDE developers "
"website is available at <ulink url=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">"
"http://developer.kde.org</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Koffice អាច​បន្ថែម​យ៉ាង​ងាយស្រួល​ជាមួយ​កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ ។ "
"ការ​អភិវឌ្ឍន៍​កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​មិន​ពិបាក "
"និង​អាច​ត្រូវ​បាន​ប្រើ​ដើម្បី​ប្ដូរ​តាម​បំណង​នូវ​លំហូរ​ការងារ​រាល់​ថ្ងៃ​របស់​អ្ន"
"ក ។ "
"ដូចជា​សមត្ថភាព​គួរ​ឲ្យ​ចាប់​អារម្មណ៍​ក្នុង​បរិស្ថាន​ពាណិជ្ជកម្ម​ដើម្បី​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ "
"Koffice ត្រូវ​តាម​តម្រូវការ​នីមួយៗ ។ អ្នក​អាច​មើល​កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​ដែល​មាន "
"ឬ​អាន​សេចក្ដី​ណែនាំ​ទូទៅ​នៅ <ulink "
"url=\"http://developer.kde.org/documentation/tutorials/developing-a-plugin-struc"
"ture/index.html\"> តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ​របស់​អ្នក​អភិវឌ្ឍន៍</ulink> "
"។ តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ​អ្នក​អភិវឌ្ឍន៍ KDE ទូទៅ​មាន​នៅ <ulink "
"url=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org</ulink> ។"
